sks, causing more callbacks. Working off of a checklist keeps you efficient and on track. No job is the same. Write down specific job notes, door codes, gate codes, property specifics at the palm of your hand and not the top of your head. No more scrolling messages of what your client texted you months ago. Keep everything all in one place. Comment checklists and I'll show you what I use.", "hook_type": "List"}]}